ci-failure.prompt:
CI run failed on branch {{ branch }}.

Workflow: {{ workflow }}
Run URL: {{ run_url }}
Commit: {{ head_sha }}

Please cancel any obsolete runs on this branch, run `gh run view {{ run_id }} --log-failed` (or dispatch a read-only forensics subagent) to diagnose the failure, and prepare a minimal fix.

ci-success.prompt:
Remote CI passed on branch {{ branch }}.

Workflow: {{ workflow }}
Run URL: {{ run_url }}
Commit: {{ head_sha }}

Please verify PR checks status (`gh pr checks`) and report to the maintainer for squash-merge and issue lifecycle closure.

review-bot.prompt:
Received review comments from {{ sender }}:

Review State: {{ review_state }}
Details:
{{ review_body }}

Please perform dialectical triage per `vinput-review` ([FIX] genuine issues, [DISMISS] domain/C-ABI/lock-free false positives, [ASK] maintainer preference). Do NOT modify code before delivering the triage report.
